{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17556","headline":"元日和布泽 · 潘孟阳","name":"元日和布泽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至德生成泰，咸欢照育恩。\n流辉沾万物，布泽在三元。\n北阕祥云逈，东方嘉气繁。\n青阳初应律，苍玉正临轩。\n恩洽因时令，风和比化原。\n自慙同草木，无以荅乾坤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘孟阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}